{"id": 72, "name": "Thamuz", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/7/74/Hero721-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20250917080630", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Chase", "Damage"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["70", "40", "20", "40"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "The lord of the Fire Demons who seeks to reignite the flames of the Abyss through war and violence.", "skills": [{"name": "Grand Lord Lava", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_d051312911931ae72d9976cdd14c973d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Thamuz's Basic Attacks have a chance of 10%–60% (scaling with <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Lava's Rage</span>) to conjure Lava Energy beneath the target that erupts after a brief delay, dealing 55<span style=\"color:#ffe63c\"> (+60% Total Physical Attack)</span><span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+8*Hero Level)</span> <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span>. Basic Attacks that don't trigger Lava Energy increase Thamuz's <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Lava's Rage</span>.\n\nWhile Thamuz is without his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scythes</span>, he gains 25% Movement Speed. After retrieving his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scythes</span>, his next Basic Attack slows the target by 30% and is guaranteed to trigger Lava Energy."}, {"name": "Molten Scythes", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_e6071a86da476531ddcd6d386aa96f4a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Thamuz tosses <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scythes</span> in the target direction. After traveling a set distance or hitting the first enemy hero, they deal 120<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scythes</span> will then slow nearby enemies by 30% and deal 45<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+20% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> every 0.5s.\n\nAfter leaving Thamuz for a short time or reaching a set distance, the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scythes</span> return to him, dragging enemies along their path toward Thamuz. Thamuz can move toward the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scythes</span> or cast the skill again to retrieve them."}, {"name": "Chasm Trample", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_40d76405ad463946a2cd7a742b69d19a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8", "desc": "Thamuz jumps to a designated area to deal 230<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slow the enemy units by 25% for 2s upon landing. \nIf the Scythes are still travelling, they will return to Thamuz and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Molten Scythes</span> will reset its CD instantly."}, {"name": "Cauterant Inferno", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_fa001f5f75ae598c8d362c04629ba328.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 38", "desc": "Thamuz spouts the lava within, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to nearby enemies and creating a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cauterant Zone</span> around himself. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cauterant Zone</span> lasts 9s and deals 30<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+10% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> every 0.5s to enemies in the area.\n\nMeanwhile, Thamuz gains 800<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+50% Extra Max HP)</span> extra Max HP, immediately healing for the same amount, and gains 60% Attack Speed. Each time his Basic Attacks or <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scythes</span> deal damage, he recovers 1.5% Max HP."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Dire Hit", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6e5971b429e55f59cf100d8920cd7c32.png"}, {"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_486be2a89fc7fba69cd82c71d80395af.png"}, {"name": "Sea Halberd", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d78fb27df8def66bd1460e851bfbf7a9.png"}, {"name": "Antique Cuirass", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f20c5fef57268ccb59a1b818c0b0c769.png"}, {"name": "Athena's Shield", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d9bb48a8df64ae5065d370adca6a5153.png"}, {"name": "Guardian Helmet", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fc3154808d5848c4b3d28ea921ee58b9.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Fighter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2153bf01770633e3251dea1f2ac6c956.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Thrill", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3a9b36ceebfebd89a7a79a5c386cfdda.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Festival of Blood", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_14e7521fcba0c60bb0128a6c3e223eaf.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Temporal Reign", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_807050a329f663017049d812034bfac8.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Retribution", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2cd084a2661c121c347facb060a80377.png"}}, {"items": [{"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/sv